            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LindaY"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We loved this cake. I changed a couple of things. I baked it in a bundt pan. I also reduced the brown sugar to a cup. The topping I did was a 1/4 cup brown sugar, oatmeal and sliced almonds with the butter and cinnamon. It is light, not too sweet so it doesn't take away from the flavor of the huckleberries. Enjoy!!!",
            "datePublished": "2014-07-16T14:11:59.277Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
